# This file is a whitelist. Anything not listed here stays out of the build
# context, so a file that exists on one machine only can never change the build.
# .cargo/config.toml is one such file. It pins PHP_CONFIG to a local path, and
# cargo applies non-forced [env] entries when the variable is unset.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!crates

# Excluded again after the whitelist, because build output is inside the trees above.
**/target
